>> title: Classic French Omelette
>> description: A simple but elegant French omelette
>> servings: 1
>> prep time: 5 minutes
>> cook time: 3 minutes
>> tags: breakfast, eggs, french

Crack @eggs{3} into a bowl and season with @salt{} and @pepper{}.

Beat the eggs with a #fork{} until well combined.

Heat @butter{1%tbsp} in a #non-stick pan{} over medium-high heat.

Pour in the eggs and let them set for ~{30%seconds}.

Using a #spatula{}, gently push the edges toward the center, tilting the pan to let uncooked egg flow to the edges.

When mostly set but still slightly wet on top, fold the omelette in thirds and slide onto a plate.

Serve immediately with fresh @chives{} on top.
